<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Yuden - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Yuden - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.48		vs	   39.67</p>
<p> Operating	    2.90		vs	    1.72</p>
<p> Current		3.50		vs	    3.47</p>
<p> Net		    2.34		vs	    2.06</p>
<p> EPS		   21.32 yen	  vs	   18.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    110 million	  vs	 110 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiyo Yuden Co Ltd makes electrolytic capacitors and ferrites.</p>
